  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening of the Binational Dialogue between Haiti and the Dominican Republic to Promote Social Cohesion in the Border Area</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through a transnational approach, the intervention aims to revitalize the Haiti - Dominican Republic Joint Bilateral Commission to structure a binational governance model that includes and recognizes a plurality of actors and institutions at the local and national level that can contribute to the improvement of relations between the two countries, the creation of spaces for conflict resolution and the reduction of violence.</narrative>
  </description>
